#%PAM-1.0
# Auth and password substack for cutefish-dm, mirroring GDM's
# gdm-password-auth-substack. password-auth's pam_unix is "sufficient":
# inside a plain include it would end the whole stack at pam_unix, so the
# pam_oo7 lines in cutefish-dm placed after it would never run. Inside a
# substack the success only ends the substack, and the outer stack
# continues with the pam_oo7 lines.
auth     include     password-auth
auth     required    pam_deny.so

password include     password-auth
password required    pam_deny.so
